      "difficulty_level": "H2",
      "difficulty_reason": "The construction expresses differentiation as an ordinary functor on a coslice category while preserving a precise linear-nonlinear compatibility. Its proof requires a nontrivial categorical composition calculation involving codereliction, comonad structure and the generalized chain rule. The full preceding pointed-chain-rule and translation arguments are retained as support, rather than assumed away.",
